				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 120 40 200 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "c53c7d25-363e-4d57-bbef-1a604bf9d380")
	)
	(text "Not fitted (in the TI WEBENCH reference):\n  RC snubber SW-GND, start 2R 0805 + 220-470pF: optional at 1MHz, needed for 16.5A OCP at 2/2.2MHz (p.16, p.29)\n  Rboot 0R in series with C28 (WEBENCH only, not in the datasheet)\n  10R in series with RSP (p.16): only for Bode injection; WEBENCH PM 67°, check with a load step instead\nCheck SW ringing on the bench: keep it 2V below abs max (p.29)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(color 210 0 0 1)
			)
